cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository is the implementation phase and has produced no results yet.
  Please cite the pilot study, listed under references, for any measured number.
title: "scoutfield: calibration-aware informative path planning for energy-constrained aerial crop scouting"
abstract: >-
  Informative path planning assumes the information signal it consumes is calibrated.
  Deep classifiers are systematically miscalibrated and degrade further under
  distribution shift. This repository couples a fine-tuned crop-disease classifier's
  calibrated uncertainty to a reinforcement learning path planner under an energy
  budget, and measures how calibration error propagates into planner performance.
  Temperature scaling holds accuracy fixed while confidence varies, isolating
  calibration as the independent variable.
authors:
